  "idea": "AppFlowy: the open-source Notion replacement that stays local",
  "text": "Stop worrying about cloud outages or rising subscription costs for your team workspace. Knowledge workers often lose progress when proprietary note platforms crash right before major client presentations. Subscription tools lock your data in closed formats, making migrating documents a painful manual chore. AppFlowy gives you full data ownership, open-source code, and offline Kanban boards without requiring internet. You regain complete control of your workspace without monthly fees.",
